DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Pretend City Children's Museum - Events\\nAges: 0-6
 0 months\\nCategory: Storytime\\n\\nJoin author and Executive Chef Glenda 
 Galván-García for a special storytime inspired by La Enchilada Complet
 a. Families will learn about the rich traditions of Mexican cuisine\, enjo
 y a live guacamole demonstration and tasting\, and explore how food brings
  people together. \nTIMES: 11am &amp\; 2:30pm\nAbout the play partner: 
 \nGlenda Galván-García is the Executive Chef at Granville’s award-wi
 nning restaurants in LA\, as well as consultant for companies such as Mi
 ssion Tortillas\, Whole Foods\, and Taco Bell. Proudly Chicana\, she loves
  sharing principles of Mexican culture through food. The Whole Enchilada 
 is her first foray into middle-grade literature. She lives in Orange Count
 y\, CA.\\n\\nMore info: https://www.pretendcity.org/events/meet-the-author
 -food-tasting-with-glenda-galvan-garcia/
LOCATION:Pretend City Children's Museum - Events\, 29 Hubble\, Irvine\, CA
 \, 92618
URL:https://www.pretendcity.org/events/meet-the-author-food-tasting-with-g
 lenda-galvan-garcia/
